      "provider": "THE ENGINE COUNT IS THE ONLY DUPLICATE COUNT THIS SCHEDULE CAN MAKE. `launches_naming` compares every engine `run` whose own operands name job-b's attempt, before and after the boundary. The PROVIDER side cannot be counted here: `agent_sessions_of` answers EMPTY for both attempts at this boundary, because neither has reached the turn that records a session, so a provider-duplicate comparison here could not fail. `composed-role-sessions` is the schedule that carries real session identities",
